_ z x c v b @x5y7 @x6y7 @x7y7 @x8y7 @x9y7 _ _
_ _ _ spc  _ _ _ _ _ _
)
(deflayer ptrmidright
_ 1 2 3 4 5 6     @xay4 @xby4 @xcy4 @xdy4 @xey4 _ _
_ q w e r t @xay5 @xby5 @xcy5 @xdy5 @xey5 [ ] \
_ a s d f g @xay6 @xby6 @xcy6 @xdy6 @xey6 ' _
_ z x c v b @xay7 @xby7 @xcy7 @xdy7 @xey7 _ _
